        <COMMENT ADDRESS="1000:0125" TYPE="pre">The typical behavior of the hardware of that era was for unmapped regions to read as 0xFF or 0xFFFF, due to the data bus lines being left floating with no hardware driving them to a defined value &#x2014; capacitance from the last bus cycle pulls them high.</COMMENT>
